OL,3,GNEWSAReform suspends councillor ahead
OL,4,Aof court case
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has suspended a councillor
OL,7,Fpending the outcome of an offensive
OL,8,Fmessage court case.
OL,10,FLast month, Sunderland City councillor
OL,11,FGlenn Gibbins, 66, was charged with
OL,12,Fposting a grossly offensive comment on
OL,13,Fsocial media in connection to a comment
OL,14,Freferencing the Nigerian community.
OL,16,FThe charge, under the Communications
OL,17,FAct 2003, related to a post from 2024.
OL,18,FGibbins is due to appear at South
OL,19,FTyneside Magistrates' Court on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
